{"id":"99bc3f450ecaa41e","group":"56","path":"56/56-cor-needed-sr-finite-projection.md","title":"有限路径投影与累计下降","display":"cor-needed-sr-finite-projection — 有限路径投影与累计下降","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-cor-needed-sr-finite-projection","aliases":["56-cor-needed-sr-finite-projection"],"display":"cor-needed-sr-finite-projection — 有限路径投影与累计下降","depends_on":["[[56-lem-needed-sr-projection]]","[[56-df-needed-sr-measure]]","[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]"],"source_section":"§9.2 Definition 9.2.25; Theorem 9.2.26 proof","source_printed_pages":"494–495","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-cleaned-measure-interface","source_proof_status":"source-proof-expanded-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-cor-needed-sr-finite-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-cor-needed-sr-finite-projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-needed-sr-finite-projection — 有限路径投影与累计下降"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"475d1dab5264244e\" href=\"?note=475d1dab5264244e\" title=\"56-lem-needed-sr-projection\">56-lem-needed-sr-projection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c5480512d7aeecf6\" href=\"?note=c5480512d7aeecf6\" title=\"56-df-needed-sr-measure\">56-df-needed-sr-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.2 Definition 9.2.25; Theorem 9.2.26 proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"494–495"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-cleaned-measure-interface"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-expanded-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定正交系统，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\\in\\mathcal P_R\">\\(\\Pi\\in\\mathcal P_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CleanNF}_R(\\Pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{CleanNF}_R(\\Pi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=S(\\Pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=S(\\Pi)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=T(\\Pi)\">\\(z=T(\\Pi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\operatorname{TPos}(z)\">\\(P=\\operatorname{TPos}(z)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_{SR},A_R,\\operatorname{PWit}_R\">\\(\\nu_{SR},A_R,\\operatorname{PWit}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c5480512d7aeecf6\" href=\"?note=c5480512d7aeecf6\" title=\"56-df-needed-sr-measure\">56-df-needed-sr-measure</a>，单步投影见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"475d1dab5264244e\" href=\"?note=475d1dab5264244e\" title=\"56-lem-needed-sr-projection\">56-lem-needed-sr-projection</a>，路径见证见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\Xi\\in\\{\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P_R:S(\\Gamma)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)\\land T(\\Gamma)=z\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{CleanNF}_R(\\Xi)\\land\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho)\\bullet\\operatorname{PWit}_R(\\Xi)\\approx_R\\operatorname{PWit}_R(\\Pi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\Xi\\in\\{\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P_R:S(\\Gamma)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)\\land T(\\Gamma)=z\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{CleanNF}_R(\\Xi)\\land\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho)\\bullet\\operatorname{PWit}_R(\\Xi)\\approx_R\\operatorname{PWit}_R(\\Pi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\land\\nu_{SR}(\\Xi,P)\\unlhd_{SR}\\nu_{SR}(\\Pi,P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\land\\nu_{SR}(\\Xi,P)\\unlhd_{SR}\\nu_{SR}(\\Pi,P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\land\\bigl((\\exists i&lt;\\ell(\\rho)\\;\\operatorname{step}_i(\\rho)\\in\\operatorname{NeedRel}_R)\\Rightarrow\\nu_{SR}(\\Xi,P)\\triangleleft_{SR}\\nu_{SR}(\\Pi,P)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\land\\bigl((\\exists i&lt;\\ell(\\rho)\\;\\operatorname{step}_i(\\rho)\\in\\operatorname{NeedRel}_R)\\Rightarrow\\nu_{SR}(\\Xi,P)\\triangleleft_{SR}\\nu_{SR}(\\Pi,P)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\land\\bigl((\\forall i&lt;\\ell(\\rho)\\;\\operatorname{step}_i(\\rho)\\notin\\operatorname{NeedRel}_R)\\Rightarrow\\nu_{SR}(\\Xi,P)=\\nu_{SR}(\\Pi,P)\\land A_R(\\Xi,P)=A_R(\\Pi,P)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\land\\bigl((\\forall i&lt;\\ell(\\rho)\\;\\operatorname{step}_i(\\rho)\\notin\\operatorname{NeedRel}_R)\\Rightarrow\\nu_{SR}(\\Xi,P)=\\nu_{SR}(\\Pi,P)\\land A_R(\\Xi,P)=A_R(\\Pi,P)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对ρ长度归纳，零步取Π。对每一个实际步骤依次使用single-step projection，当前输入始终为CleanNF且终点始终是z。每步ν非增，实际needed步严格下降；只要出现一次严格下降，传递性使累计比较严格。若没有needed步，逐步的等值测度与前缀坐标等式拼接。置换square沿bullet结合与同余拼接。这里needed在每一步当时的源项判定，不能改成只收缩初始needed集合的成员。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-lem-needed-sr-projection","status":"resolved","id":"475d1dab5264244e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-lem-needed-sr-projection]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-needed-sr-measure","status":"resolved","id":"c5480512d7aeecf6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-needed-sr-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"c273fed319bca9e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-needed-sr-measure","status":"resolved","id":"c5480512d7aeecf6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定正交系统，$\\Pi\\in\\mathcal P_R$ 且 $\\operatorname{CleanNF}_R(\\Pi)$，$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=S(\\Pi)$；$z=T(\\Pi)$，$P=\\operatorname{TPos}(z)$。$\\nu_{SR},A_R,\\operatorname{PWit}_R$ 见 [[56-df-needed-sr-measure]]，单步投影见 [[56-lem-needed-sr-projection]]，路径见证见 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-lem-needed-sr-projection","status":"resolved","id":"475d1dab5264244e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定正交系统，$\\Pi\\in\\mathcal P_R$ 且 $\\operatorname{CleanNF}_R(\\Pi)$，$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=S(\\Pi)$；$z=T(\\Pi)$，$P=\\operatorname{TPos}(z)$。$\\nu_{SR},A_R,\\operatorname{PWit}_R$ 见 [[56-df-needed-sr-measure]]，单步投影见 [[56-lem-needed-sr-projection]]，路径见证见 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"c273fed319bca9e3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文